      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚀 HireFlow — Onboarding Autopilot\nWhen a candidate turns Hired, this builds their role-specific onboarding checklist in the ATS, drafts a welcome email, books a Day-1 orientation, and flags them done so nobody's onboarded twice.\n**n8n · OpenAI · Airtable · Gmail · Google Calendar**",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -400
      ],
      "id": "10a8b285-fe30-4797-b8d4-5db63ffc7fa5",
      "name": "Sticky 14a41234"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1 · Poll for new hires\nSchedule + Airtable Search for Stage = Hired AND Onboarding Created = FALSE. Poll-not-push: it can't miss the moment someone is hired, and the flag guarantees no one is onboarded twice.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -10,
        -240
      ],
      "id": "e809df64-5748-4ba1-80bb-50fc3e5ffec4",
      "name": "Sticky a3086636"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2 · Generate checklist\ngpt-4o-mini writes a role-specific onboarding checklist (IT provisioning, HR paperwork, manager 1:1s, role ramp) as structured JSON.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 200,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        406,
        -240
      ],
      "id": "188f550a-0c99-4108-894e-cd6a7fb07314",
      "name": "Sticky 8eed9933"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3 · Write checklist rows\nCode explodes the checklist into one item each; Create a record writes them to the Onboarding table with owner, due day, and a doc-required flag.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        614,
        -240
