      "id": "b3472ae9-171c-4449-bcd0-1bc6482eabd8",
      "name": "Sticky 7a256945"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4 · Prep + guard\nBranched off the CANDIDATE stream (not the rows) so it fires ONCE, not per checklist item: a Gmail welcome DRAFT + a Day-1 calendar event, then Update flips Onboarding Created = true so the next poll skips this hire.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 680,
        "color": 5
      },
